{
  "_comment": "Shared vision scenarios. Tokens are in grid units (x from the left, y from the bottom row); walls, lights and samples are map pixels (y from the top). Both packages run every scenario; the backend checks which tokens are sent, the frontend checks the tier at each sample and that a token is seen exactly when it is sent. Keep both copies identical.",
